flowchart TD
    Raw[One normalized SearchResult] --> Identity{Plausible title identity?}
    Identity -->|no| NoPerson[person_not_established]
    Identity -->|yes| Direct{Academic title or matching named role?}
    Direct -->|yes| Institution
    Direct -->|no| Profile{Conservative profile conjunction}

    Profile --> URL[Singular person-profile URL]
    Profile --> Same[Same identity tied positively to bounded scholarly context]
    Profile --> Coherent[No unsupported identity conflict]
    Profile --> Topic[Identity is not a planned research-topic phrase]
    URL --> All{All signals agree?}
    Same --> All
    Coherent --> All
    Topic --> All
    All -->|no, different academic only| Conflict[identity_conflict]
    All -->|no| NoContext[academic_context_not_established]
    All -->|yes| Institution{Title or owner-linked complete institution?}

    Institution -->|no, truncated| Incomplete[incomplete_institution]
    Institution -->|no, absent| NoInstitution[institution_not_established]
    Institution -->|yes| Prospective[Prospective Supervisor + exact provenance]

    classDef reject fill:#fff0f0,stroke:#a33;
    class NoPerson,Conflict,NoContext,Incomplete,NoInstitution reject;
